node_modules/
test-results/
playwright-report/
_site/
.DS_Store
/output/
/tmp/
# wrangler's local simulator state. it is also the reason `wrangler kv key list`
# answers `[]` for any namespace at all unless `--remote` is passed.
.wrangler/
# the lock file is committed: CI installs from it, and a browser driver that
# drifts version by version proves nothing

# where a real Stripe key would land if it ever landed on this disk.
#
# `wrangler dev` reads .dev.vars by default, so it is the file any tutorial
# tells you to create, and none of them mentions that it sits inside a git
# repository. Nothing in club/LAUNCH.md asks for one, which is the reason to
# write this rule now rather than after: a rule added the day the file appears
# is a rule added one commit too late.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
.env
.env.*
